I wanted to take a moment to introduce myself.  My name is Chris
Smith, and I am a new maintainer of the NFS Howto hosted at:
http://nfs.sourceforge.net/nfs-howto/.  In the interest of:

*document consolidation
*accessibility and easy content modification and contribution

I have been working with Bryce Harrington (the maintainer of the NFS /
NFSv4 Wiki (http://wiki.linux-nfs.org/) to migrate the existing NFS
Howto to be maintained in the same location.  I was hoping to solicit
some comments and feedback on whether this is a positive direction for
the document to move towards.  I also want to make sure that the
method proposed in the document for managing its content is
satisfactory to all interested parties as well.

http://wiki.linux-nfs.org/index.php/NFS_Howto

Is the location of the new document.  I look forward to your comments.

Best,
